# Cursor Rules for AI Agent

You must follow these guidelines strictly during your execution.

## 1. Documentation Review
Before proposing or making changes, read the following files from the project root:
- `docs/AIDLC.md` for workflow phases.
- `docs/PRODUCT_RULES.md` for core business domain logic.
- `docs/SECURITY_RULES.md` for security constraints.
- `docs/TESTING_GUIDE.md` for verification and building guidelines.
- `docs/CHANGELOG_AI.md` to review recent technical implementations.

## 2. Coding Integrity
- Do not remove existing comments/docstrings unless requested.
- Ensure type-safety and robust error handling.
- Verify compilation before marking a task as complete.

## 3. Handover
Always update `docs/CHANGELOG_AI.md` at the end of the session to keep track of your changes.
